g/workshop2h/pdf-source/sticker.png" alt="Sticker Set 角色貼圖組的範例圖" loading="lazy"/></a><div class="tool-name">Sticker Set 角色貼圖組</div><div class="tool-tag">（角色變化）</div><div class="tool-summary">固定角色外觀並變化動作。</div><div class="tool-list"><div class="tool-list-item"><span class="tool-check">→</span><a download href="img/workshop2h/pdf-source/sticker.png">下載 PNG</a></div></div></div><div class="tool-card"><a download href="img/workshop2h/pdf-source/lookbook.png"><img src="img/workshop2h/pdf-source/lookbook.png" alt="Lookbook Grid 服飾系列拼貼的範例圖" loading="lazy"/></a><div class="tool-name">Lookbook Grid 服飾系列拼貼</div><div class="tool-tag">（服飾系列）</div><div class="tool-summary">以六套服飾呈現系列調性。</div><div class="tool-list"><div class="tool-list-item"><span class="tool-check">→</span><a download href="img/workshop2h/pdf-source/lookbook.png">下載 PNG</a></div></div></div></div>
